    "L6": "The frequency table shows samosa 6, poha 3, and idli 3.",
    "L7": "Check the total: 6 plus 3 plus 3 equals 12, the number of answers.",
    "L8": "Now the table answers quickly: samosa is the favourite, and it has three more than poha."
